	* 1.0.0-11:
	- CPU Optimization: Cache shell PID to eliminate 200ms /proc scan loop (idle CPU dropped from ~10% to 0.0%)
	- Live Mode File: Poll /run/nabu-tablet-mode/mode directly so unprivileged users can toggle modes without root
	- Resume Pulse: Fix wake/retrigger state pulse on resume regardless of current mode
	- Systemd: Add StartLimitIntervalSec=0 and RestartSec=2s to nabu-ssc.conf
	- Changelog: Add interactive in-terminal update notifications and package changelog
